        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"13e704c8-07b9-44ec-ab0d-c263862ef8c7\",\"review_text\":\"Its ok put up with the comershals and is good free\"},{\"review_id\":\"0404b73a-0fa0-4912-9715-943bea69ed89\",\"review_text\":\"Leave\"},{\"review_id\":\"a17f6c53-a522-4f70-95d0-ad3b620cba55\",\"review_text\":\"Sweet👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"36a00bb2-6ab7-4f17-96c9-66b31331f9dd\",\"review_text\":\"Only advertisement for our premium\"},{\"review_id\":\"0e62ae52-7081-4e1a-b5a3-ecb4b410ed42\",\"review_text\":\"Goods make premium free\"},{\"review_id\":\"d2259163-18e0-48ac-b7ce-bcc866702e6e\",\"review_text\":\"I like this app but after updating 😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"4270b1a8-c336-4353-9b82-c79586e34308\",\"review_text\":\"Earlier it was the best app for music but now for almost everything we have to take the premium subscription😡. I was using this app from last 1 year but now it's a big disappointment 👎👎🏻👎🏼👎🏽👎🏾👎🏿. I hope Spotify will make this app normal as it was earlier. I also wanted to say that plz try don't to update this app.🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"db9a929c-eec4-4bd3-931a-0cbb5879d88e\",\"review_text\":\"The main problem with this app is it starts playing automatically. That's very disturbing, particularly in office time. So I'm uninstalling this app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"6121743c-bd22-4f8c-a689-645b4a0cfa00\",\"review_text\":\"Worst App ever ..💩\"},{\"review_id\":\"21c1a889-0c42-48ad-ac5b-fd81febf8708\",\"review_text\":\"I have been using this app from one year but recent update I facing many problems.\"}]}"
